cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Cluster validation for a hierarchical topic taxonomy of AI research
message: >-
  If you use this software or its results, please cite both the software and
  the associated article.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/Pigeon-Effect/qss_publication
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of the two large-language-model validation protocols
  used to assess a hierarchical topic taxonomy of artificial-intelligence
  research derived from 1,986,659 OpenAlex records (2020-2025): document
  intrusion detection, adapted from the "reading tea leaves" paradigm of Chang
  et al. (2009), and Likert-scale cluster coherence rating following Tan and
  D'Souza (2025).
keywords:
  - scientometrics
  - topic modeling
  - cluster validation
  - intrusion detection
  - large language models
  - OpenAlex
  - artificial intelligence

